        "Basic House Commands:~",
        "- \"/edithouse\" Opens the Map Editor to edit your own house. \"/houseentrance\" Sets the spawn point of your house when you visit it. \"/housesign\" Adds a sign on the tile you are standing on. \"/housesound\" Places a Sound Tile that plays a sound effect on the tile you are standing on. ",
        "\"/houselight\" Changes the Light/Dark settings of the house. \"/houseroof\" Opens the roof of the house to set weather conditions and allow the change of time. \"/houseweather\" Sets the house weather. \"/housexpand\" Expands the house size."
